bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "Register / Login Page" as UI
boundary Router
control AuthController
control AuthService
control MailerService


User -> UI: 1. Request email verification
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. POST /api/auth/send-verify-email (email)
activate Router

Router -> AuthController: 3. sendVerifyEmail(email)
activate AuthController

AuthController -> AuthService: 4. sendVerificationEmail(email)
activate AuthService

AuthService -> AuthService: 5. Check email, rate limit
activate AuthService
space
deactivate AuthService

alt Invalid email
    AuthService --> AuthController: 5.1.1 Throw BadRequestException
    AuthController --> Router: 5.1.2 HTTP 400 response
    Router --> UI: 5.1.3 Show invalid email error
    UI --> User: 5.1.4 Invalid email
else Rate limit exceeded
    AuthService --> AuthController: 5.2.1 Throw BadRequestException
    AuthController --> Router: 5.2.2 HTTP 400 response
    Router --> UI: 5.2.3 Show rate limit error
    UI --> User: 5.2.4 Try again later
end

AuthService -> AuthService: 6. Generate verification token (JWT)
activate AuthService
space
deactivate AuthService

AuthService -> MailerService: 7. Send verification email
activate MailerService

MailerService --> AuthService: 8. Email sent / error
deactivate MailerService


opt Email service unavailable
    AuthService --> AuthController: 8.1 Throw InternalServerErrorException
    AuthController --> Router: 8.2 HTTP 500 response
    Router --> UI: 8.3 Show system error
    UI --> User: 8.4 Unable to send email
end

ref over AuthService: 3.3.b.i. Subsequence - Update user verify code

AuthService -> AuthService: 9. Check update
activate AuthService
space
deactivate AuthService

opt Verification info update failed
    AuthService --> AuthController: 9.1 Throw InternalServerErrorException
    AuthController --> Router: 9.2 HTTP 500 response
    Router --> UI: 9.3 Show system error
    UI --> User: 9.4 Verification update failed
end

AuthService --> AuthController: 10. Return success message
deactivate AuthService

AuthController --> Router: 11. HTTP 200 response
deactivate AuthController

Router --> UI: 12. Verification email sent
deactivate Router

UI --> User: 13. Check email inbox
deactivate UI
deactivate User